        "market_blurb": "Muskegon, Michigan's economy is anchored by manufacturing, healthcare, and Lake Michigan-driven tourism, with a working waterfront that supports shipping and marine industries. Trinity Health/Mercy Health Muskegon and Alcoa Howmet remain major employment pillars, while summer tourism along the Muskegon Lake and Lake Michigan shoreline brings seasonal economic activity. The city continues a long transition from its historic lumber and heavy-manufacturing base toward healthcare, education, and recreation-driven commerce.",
